// Jackson County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's property
// search, the Board of Elections, Wellston City Schools and the Wellston library)
// were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's property search is still Pivot Point at jacksoncountyauditor.org;
//     the Auditor's office pages and forms are also hosted by Schneider Geospatial.
//   * The Jackson City Library's current site is jacksoncitylibrary.org (the www
//     address shows an old 2018 page).
//   * OhioMeansJobs now points to the county JFS workforce page instead of the
//     statewide site.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Jackson County MI/MS/MO/OR/WV and others; Jackson MI/MS/TN; Wellston OK/MO; Oak
//   Hill WV/FL; jswcd.org is Oregon and jacksonswcd.specialdistrict.org is Florida;
//   Lake Alma State Park is Vinton County.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Two cities (Jackson, the seat, and Wellston); villages Oak Hill and Coalton.
//   * Three school districts (Jackson City, Wellston City, Oak Hill Union Local);
//     career-tech is Buckeye Hills Career Center; the University of Rio Grande has
//     a Jackson Center.
//   * Several bodies are shared: Jackson-Vinton Community Action, the Jackson-Vinton
//     Farm Bureau, the Gallia-Jackson-Meigs ADAMH Board and solid waste district.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * The Telegram News: a real paper, but its page description carries casino
//     spam, a sign of compromise; it also covers mainly Vinton County.
//   * Hijacked or dead domains: jacksonareaymca.org (now a clothing store), the
//     Markay theater sites (spam injected), thelocalgallery.com (for sale),
//     wellstonmainstreet.com (gone). oakhillchamber.org shows a certificate error.
//   * Soil & Water, land bank, park district, airport, townships, humane society,
//     United Way, domestic violence shelter, Habitat and senior centers: no website
//     or Facebook only. Lake Katharine and Cooper Hollow: no working state page.
//   * Private businesses (lodging, bowling) and vendor portals (Recorder, sheriff
//     sales, CourtView).

